            <ArticleTitle>A double-blind trial of ketoprofen in the treatment of osteoarthritis of the hip.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>129-32</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In a double-blind study of ketoprofen versus placebo in the treatment of osteoarthritis of the hip, it was shown by a sequential technique, that ketoprofen was significantly better than placebo. Some intolerance was observed but no more than with other non-steroidal antiinflammatory drugs. No changes were observed in biological parameters.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
